{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Save a culinary reflection (content state \"proposed\"), then attempt feed publication. Requires an authenticated non-synthetic caller; debits 0.1 of each ESMS token (0.4 total) in the same transaction that saves the reflection. Without an idempotency key every call creates another reflection and charges again; with one, a retry returns the original reflection and re-attempts a failed feed publication. Pass arguments._meta.idempotencyKey to retry safely: identical arguments within 24 hours replay the original settlement instead of charging again, and the result's billing field reports what happened. Optional arguments._meta.apiKey or MCP_USER_API_KEY (or ALCHM_MCP_USER_API_KEY) authenticates a caller; arguments._meta.caller identifies the client. Anonymous reads use demo mode. Credentials are validated only with the operator's DATABASE_URL configured.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"_apiKey":{"maxLength":512,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"_authKey":{"maxLength":512,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"_meta":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"apiKey":{"maxLength":512,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"authKey":{"maxLength":512,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"caller":{"maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"correlationId":{"maxLength":128,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"evidenceSnapshotId":{"maxLength":128,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"idempotencyKey":{"description":"Optional retry key for paid tools. Reusing it with identical arguments within 24 hours replays the original settlement instead of charging again; reusing it with different arguments, or later, is rejected.","maxLength":200,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9._:~-]+$","type":"string"},"internalSecret":{"maxLength":512,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"requestId":{"maxLength":128,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"traceId":{"maxLength":128,"minLength":